00:25:49.630 --> 00:25:50.950
our Twitter account--

00:25:50.950 --> 00:25:54.160
DataforSDGs-- and to
subscribe to our newsletter.

00:25:54.160 --> 00:25:58.180
We really strive to provide
interesting information

00:25:58.180 --> 00:26:00.460
and ways to engage not
only with a partnership

00:26:00.460 --> 00:26:02.565
but also with a whole network.

